<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-DVORAK WINS WORLD DECATHLON TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-DVORAK WINS WORLD DECATHLON TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cezch Tomas Dvorak won the world decathlon gold medal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Eduard Hamalainen of Finland took the silver and German Frank Busemann the bronze.</p>
</text>
